  "added_files_note": "AQ_PORT.json excludes its own hash; root repository provenance records the whole family.",
  "behavior": {
    "bimmer_blocks": "Original finite/nonnegative speed <=0.5km/h, <10s age, visibility/focus, manual pause, game engine and local scores are preserved. ID8 additionally requires fresh read-only speed health (2s polling, 6s maximum age). Provider loss, errors and unknown speed keep the game paused.",
    "bounded_requests": "Only the already-declared Vehicle2.statusCarSpeed2 getter/subscription; one unresolved getter per field. Its 3.5s reporting timeout never creates a second pending getter. Shutdown closes subscriptions and timers.",
    "vehicle_pass": "No vehicle signals or diagnostic calls. Main/model/fonts are byte-identical; manual records, schema migration, backup and corrupt-file preservation retain original behavior.",
    "id7": "Generator equality tested for both applications in en/de/ru/zh-CN; AppStudio immediate display visibility retained; actual game decisions compared against original.",
    "id8": "Native list/button resources, dynamic loaded-HMI marker, resource/init/map/availability entry sequence, valid native touch application area and explicit missing-renderer fallback.",
    "paths": "Relative RHMI resources and platform dataDir. No ID7 MainApp path is guessed for ID8 MainApp21.",
    "controller": "Exclusive controller capture requires renderer/controller/input-gate support; compatible touch and native buttons remain distinct from that capability."
  },
